[[{'duration': 3.6, 'start': 0.0, 'text': 'Think about how quickly you can'},
  {'duration': 4.64, 'start': 1.44, 'text': 'recognize a scene.'},
  {'duration': 4.24,
   'start': 3.6,
   'text': 'A blurry photo flashes on a screen. At'},
  {'duration': 3.92,
   'start': 6.08,
   'text': "first, you don't know exactly what it"},
  {'duration': 4.88,
   'start': 7.84,
   'text': 'is, but you can already tell there are'},
  {'duration': 5.24,
   'start': 10.0,
   'text': 'edges, light and dark regions, maybe'},
  {'duration': 4.8, 'start': 12.72, 'text': 'something upright in the middle.'},
  {'duration': 4.48,
   'start': 15.24,
   'text': 'A moment later, as the image sharpens,'},
  {'duration': 4.44, 'start': 17.52, 'text': 'you see a blurry face.'},
  {'duration': 5.24,
   'start': 19.72,
   'text': 'Then, a moment later, you see your'},
  {'duration': 5.4,
   'start': 21.96,
   'text': 'friend standing in front of a building.'},
  {'duration': 5.52,
   'start': 24.96,
   'text': "Your brain didn't identify every pixel"},
  {'duration': 5.399,
   'start': 27.36,
   'text': 'one by one. It moved through layers of'},
  {'duration': 4.2,
   'start': 30.48,
   'text': 'understanding. That simple fact turns'},
  {'duration': 5.041,
   'start': 32.759,
   'text': 'out to connect two subjects that seem'},
  {'duration': 4.48,
   'start': 34.68,
   'text': 'worlds apart. Deep learning and modern'},
  {'duration': 3.4, 'start': 37.8, 'text': 'physics.'},
  {'duration': 3.96, 'start': 39.16, 'text': "Here's the surprising idea."},
  {'duration': 4.48,
   'start': 41.2,
   'text': 'One of the main reasons deep learning'},
  {'duration': 5.08,
   'start': 43.12,
   'text': 'works is that it uses a strategy very'},
  {'duration': 4.44,
   'start': 45.68,
   'text': 'similar to one that physicists use to'},
  {'duration': 3.96, 'start': 48.2, 'text': 'understand the universe.'},
  {'duration': 4.68,
   'start': 50.12,
   'text': 'And the reason is that both deep'},
  {'duration': 5.24,
   'start': 52.16,
   'text': 'learning and physics face the same'},
  {'duration': 4.52,
   'start': 54.8,
   'text': 'fundamental problem. Reality contains'},
  {'duration': 3.56, 'start': 57.4, 'text': 'too much detail. So, if you want'},
  {'duration': 3.88, 'start': 59.32, 'text': 'understanding, prediction, or'},
  {'duration': 4.92,
   'start': 60.96,
   'text': 'intelligence, you need a principled way'},
  {'duration': 4.8,
   'start': 63.2,
   'text': 'to decide which details matter and which'},
  {'duration': 4.92, 'start': 65.88, 'text': 'can be safely ignored.'},
  {'duration': 4.76,
   'start': 68.0,
   'text': 'That is the whole story in one sentence.'},
  {'duration': 4.8,
   'start': 70.8,
   'text': 'Complexity becomes manageable when you'},
  {'duration': 5.6,
   'start': 72.76,
   'text': 'organize it by scale. Once you see that,'},
  {'duration': 4.96,
   'start': 75.6,
   'text': 'the word deep in deep learning starts to'},
  {'duration': 5.4, 'start': 78.36, 'text': 'mean something more than big or'},
  {'duration': 5.56,
   'start': 80.56,
   'text': 'complicated. It starts to mean arranged'},
  {'duration': 4.76,
   'start': 83.76,
   'text': 'in levels, where each level handles a'},
  {'duration': 4.36,
   'start': 86.12,
   'text': 'different zoom setting on reality. To'},
  {'duration': 3.12,
   'start': 88.52,
   'text': 'see why this matters, start with an'},
  {'duration': 2.92, 'start': 90.48, 'text': 'image.'},
  {'duration': 4.04,
   'start': 91.64,
   'text': 'A high-resolution photograph might'},
  {'duration': 3.68, 'start': 93.4, 'text': 'contain millions of pixels.'},
  {'duration': 3.32,
   'start': 95.68,
   'text': 'If you tried to understand it by'},
  {'duration': 4.36, 'start': 97.08, 'text': 'treating every pixel as equally'},
  {'duration': 4.68,
   'start': 99.0,
   'text': 'important and unrelated to the rest,'},
  {'duration': 4.48, 'start': 101.44, 'text': "you'd drown in detail."},
  {'duration': 4.72,
   'start': 103.68,
   'text': 'But the world is kinder than that.'},
  {'duration': 4.08,
   'start': 105.92,
   'text': 'Nearby pixels are usually related. They'},
  {'duration': 4.48, 'start': 108.4, 'text': 'form edges.'},
  {'duration': 5.32,
   'start': 110.0,
   'text': 'Edges combine into textures. Textures'},
  {'duration': 4.64,
   'start': 112.88,
   'text': 'become parts, like eyes, wheels,'},
  {'duration': 4.56, 'start': 115.32, 'text': 'windows, and fur.'},
  {'duration': 5.12, 'start': 117.52, 'text': 'Parts combine into objects.'},
  {'duration': 4.72, 'start': 119.88, 'text': 'Objects combine into scenes.'},
  {'duration': 3.839,
   'start': 122.64,
   'text': 'That layered structure is not something'},
  {'duration': 3.76, 'start': 124.6, 'text': 'we invented for computers.'},
  {'duration': 3.601,
   'start': 126.479,
   'text': "It's already in the world, and physics"},
  {'duration': 3.04, 'start': 128.36, 'text': 'runs into the same issue.'},
  {'duration': 3.84, 'start': 130.08, 'text': 'A piece of metal contains an'},
  {'duration': 4.68,
   'start': 131.4,
   'text': 'unimaginable number of atoms. The'},
  {'duration': 4.56,
   'start': 133.92,
   'text': 'atmosphere contains countless molecules'},
  {'duration': 4.28, 'start': 136.08, 'text': 'colliding in every direction.'},
  {'duration': 3.96,
   'start': 138.48,
   'text': 'If you tried to predict a magnet or a'},
  {'duration': 4.88,
   'start': 140.36,
   'text': 'storm by tracking every particle'},
  {'duration': 4.8,
   'start': 142.44,
   'text': "individually, you'd never finish."},
  {'duration': 4.48,
   'start': 145.24,
   'text': 'Yet physicists can still say useful'},
  {'duration': 5.12, 'start': 147.24, 'text': 'things about pressure,'},
  {'duration': 3.96, 'start': 149.72, 'text': 'magnetism, or turbulence.'},
  {'duration': 3.52, 'start': 152.36, 'text': 'How?'},
  {'duration': 4.72,
   'start': 153.68,
   'text': 'By not insisting that every microscopic'},
  {'duration': 4.6,
   'start': 155.88,
   'text': 'detail deserves equal attention. And'},
  {'duration': 3.92,
   'start': 158.4,
   'text': 'that is a counterintuitive lesson. We'},
  {'duration': 4.04, 'start': 160.48, 'text': 'often assume that more detail'},
  {'duration': 4.48,
   'start': 162.32,
   'text': 'automatically means more understanding,'},
  {'duration': 5.08,
   'start': 164.52,
   'text': 'but past a certain point, extra detail'},
  {'duration': 4.88,
   'start': 166.8,
   'text': 'becomes noise unless it is organized. A'},
  {'duration': 4.48,
   'start': 169.6,
   'text': 'phone book contains lots of information,'},
  {'duration': 4.56,
   'start': 171.68,
   'text': 'but not much wisdom. Understanding'},
  {'duration': 3.52,
   'start': 174.08,
   'text': 'requires compression. Not random'},
  {'duration': 3.96,
   'start': 176.24,
   'text': 'compression that throws things away'},
  {'duration': 4.68,
   'start': 177.6,
   'text': 'carelessly, but smart compression that'},
  {'duration': 4.64,
   'start': 180.2,
   'text': 'preserves what matters for the question'},
  {'duration': 4.2,
   'start': 182.28,
   'text': "you're asking. Physicists have a famous"},
  {'duration': 3.6, 'start': 184.84, 'text': 'way of doing this called'},
  {'duration': 3.52, 'start': 186.48, 'text': 'renormalization.'},
  {'duration': 3.92,
   'start': 188.44,
   'text': 'The name sounds forbidding, but the'},
  {'duration': 4.88, 'start': 190.0, 'text': 'basic intuition is simple.'},
  {'duration': 4.32, 'start': 192.36, 'text': 'Imagine zooming out on a map.'},
  {'duration': 4.12,
   'start': 194.88,
   'text': 'At the scale of a whole continent,'},
  {'duration': 4.279,
   'start': 196.68,
   'text': 'street corners disappear, and national'},
  {'duration': 4.44, 'start': 199.0, 'text': 'borders matter.'},
  {'duration': 4.56,
   'start': 200.959,
   'text': 'Zoom into a city and highways matter'},
  {'duration': 4.2, 'start': 203.44, 'text': 'more than mountain ranges.'},
  {'duration': 4.321,
   'start': 205.519,
   'text': 'Zoom further into a neighborhood, and'},
  {'duration': 3.72,
   'start': 207.64,
   'text': 'now doorways and traffic lights are'},
  {'duration': 3.56, 'start': 209.84, 'text': 'relevant.'},
  {'duration': 3.32,
   'start': 211.36,
   'text': 'There is no single perfect description'},
  {'duration': 2.88, 'start': 213.4, 'text': 'of the map.'},
  {'duration': 4.32,
   'start': 214.68,
   'text': 'The right description depends on the'},
  {'duration': 5.239,
   'start': 216.28,
   'text': 'scale you care about. And that is the'},
  {'duration': 4.68,
   'start': 219.0,
   'text': 'heart of renormalization. Repeatedly'},
  {'duration': 5.201,
   'start': 221.519,
   'text': 'zoom out while keeping the features that'},
  {'duration': 4.76,
   'start': 223.68,
   'text': 'still influence large-scale behavior.'},
  {'duration': 3.6,
   'start': 226.72,
   'text': 'Another everyday word for this is'},
  {'duration': 3.68, 'start': 228.44, 'text': 'coarse-graining.'},
  {'duration': 2.8,
   'start': 230.32,
   'text': 'Suppose you have a crowd seen from far'},
  {'duration': 3.2, 'start': 232.12, 'text': 'away.'},
  {'duration': 4.44,
   'start': 233.12,
   'text': "You don't track each person's shoelaces,"},
  {'duration': 4.04,
   'start': 235.32,
   'text': 'facial expression, and heartbeat. You'},
  {'duration': 4.12, 'start': 237.56, 'text': 'summarize groups.'},
  {'duration': 4.84,
   'start': 239.36,
   'text': "There's a dense cluster here, a flow of"},
  {'duration': 3.92,
   'start': 241.68,
   'text': 'movement there, a gap opening near the'},
  {'duration': 3.52, 'start': 244.2, 'text': 'exit.'},
  {'duration': 4.76,
   'start': 245.6,
   'text': 'Many tiny details are bundled into a'},
  {'duration': 5.44,
   'start': 247.72,
   'text': 'simpler, meaningful description.'},
  {'duration': 4.599,
   'start': 250.36,
   'text': 'You lose information, yes, but ideally,'},
  {'duration': 3.079,
   'start': 253.16,
   'text': "you lose the kind that doesn't matter"},
  {'duration': 4.441,
   'start': 254.959,
   'text': "for the pattern you're trying to"},
  {'duration': 5.241,
   'start': 256.239,
   'text': 'understand. And now return to a neural'},
  {'duration': 4.28,
   'start': 259.4,
   'text': 'network. In a good vision system, the'},
  {'duration': 4.48,
   'start': 261.48,
   'text': 'early layers often detect very simple'},
  {'duration': 4.2,
   'start': 263.68,
   'text': 'patterns, such as edges or small color'},
  {'duration': 3.72, 'start': 265.96, 'text': 'contrasts.'},
  {'duration': 4.28,
   'start': 267.88,
   'text': 'The next layers combine those into'},
  {'duration': 4.32, 'start': 269.68, 'text': 'textures or corners.'},
  {'duration': 4.44,
   'start': 272.16,
   'text': 'Higher layers combine those into'},
  {'duration': 5.56,
   'start': 274.0,
   'text': 'meaningful parts, and eventually into'},
  {'duration': 5.24, 'start': 276.6, 'text': 'whole objects and scenes.'},
  {'duration': 5.04,
   'start': 279.56,
   'text': 'In other words, each layer creates a'},
  {'duration': 4.8,
   'start': 281.84,
   'text': 'coarser, more abstract description of'},
  {'duration': 4.28,
   'start': 284.6,
   'text': 'the one below it. This is one reason'},
  {'duration': 5.36,
   'start': 286.64,
   'text': 'that it is true, but incomplete, to say'},
  {'duration': 5.52,
   'start': 288.88,
   'text': 'neural networks are just curve fitting.'},
  {'duration': 4.96, 'start': 292.0, 'text': 'They are fitting patterns, yes,'},
  {'duration': 3.8,
   'start': 294.4,
   'text': 'but they are also building hierarchies.'},
  {'duration': 3.4, 'start': 296.96, 'text': 'They are learning what kinds of'},
  {'duration': 4.44,
   'start': 298.2,
   'text': 'summaries are useful at each level.'},
  {'duration': 4.28,
   'start': 300.36,
   'text': "That's the deeper bridge to physics."},
  {'duration': 3.84,
   'start': 302.64,
   'text': 'Deep learning works so well in part'},
  {'duration': 3.6,
   'start': 304.64,
   'text': 'because the world itself has structure'},
  {'duration': 3.24, 'start': 306.48, 'text': 'across scales.'},
  {'duration': 3.04, 'start': 308.24, 'text': 'Images do.'},
  {'duration': 3.08, 'start': 309.72, 'text': 'Language does.'},
  {'duration': 3.76, 'start': 311.28, 'text': 'Audio does.'},
  {'duration': 4.48, 'start': 312.8, 'text': 'Physical systems do.'},
  {'duration': 4.32,
   'start': 315.04,
   'text': 'Nearby things tend to be more strongly'},
  {'duration': 5.36, 'start': 317.28, 'text': 'related than distant things.'},
  {'duration': 5.28,
   'start': 319.36,
   'text': 'Small patterns combine into larger ones.'},
  {'duration': 3.4,
   'start': 322.64,
   'text': 'Local regularities support global'},
  {'duration': 3.76, 'start': 324.64, 'text': 'meaning.'},
  {'duration': 4.2,
   'start': 326.04,
   'text': 'Depth is a sequence of zoom levels,'},
  {'duration': 3.72,
   'start': 328.4,
   'text': 'rather than just extra computation'},
  {'duration': 3.64,
   'start': 330.24,
   'text': 'stacked for no reason. This is very'},
  {'duration': 3.56,
   'start': 332.12,
   'text': 'close to how physicists think when they'},
  {'duration': 3.8,
   'start': 333.88,
   'text': 'study systems with huge numbers of'},
  {'duration': 5.04, 'start': 335.68, 'text': 'interacting parts.'},
  {'duration': 6.2,
   'start': 337.68,
   'text': 'Imagine starting with microscopic chaos.'},
  {'duration': 5.52,
   'start': 340.72,
   'text': 'Atoms vibrating, spins flipping, tiny'},
  {'duration': 4.28, 'start': 343.88, 'text': 'interactions everywhere.'},
  {'duration': 4.16, 'start': 346.24, 'text': 'Then apply a'},
  {'duration': 4.12,
   'start': 348.16,
   'text': 'Compress local details, but keep'},
  {'duration': 3.36,
   'start': 350.4,
   'text': 'whatever still affects larger-scale'},
  {'duration': 3.52, 'start': 352.28, 'text': 'behavior.'},
  {'duration': 3.6, 'start': 353.76, 'text': 'Then, do it again.'},
  {'duration': 3.88, 'start': 355.8, 'text': 'And again.'},
  {'duration': 4.2,
   'start': 357.36,
   'text': 'As you repeat this, some details wash'},
  {'duration': 3.24,
   'start': 359.68,
   'text': 'out, while some patterns remain'},
  {'duration': 3.72, 'start': 361.56, 'text': 'important.'},
  {'duration': 5.64,
   'start': 362.92,
   'text': 'The process traces what physicists call'},
  {'duration': 5.2, 'start': 365.28, 'text': 'a flow across scales.'},
  {'duration': 3.52,
   'start': 368.56,
   'text': 'This is one of the most elegant ideas in'},
  {'duration': 3.68,
   'start': 370.48,
   'text': 'physics, because very different'},
  {'duration': 4.92,
   'start': 372.08,
   'text': 'microscopic systems can start to look'},
  {'duration': 4.08,
   'start': 374.16,
   'text': 'the same when viewed at the right scale.'},
  {'duration': 4.64,
   'start': 377.0,
   'text': "That's one of the big miracles of"},
  {'duration': 5.08,
   'start': 378.24,
   'text': 'physics, sometimes called universality.'},
  {'duration': 3.8,
   'start': 381.64,
   'text': 'Two materials can have completely'},
  {'duration': 4.72,
   'start': 383.32,
   'text': 'different atomic makeup and still behave'},
  {'duration': 4.64,
   'start': 385.44,
   'text': 'similarly near phase transition, like'},
  {'duration': 3.72,
   'start': 388.04,
   'text': 'iron becoming magnetized and water'},
  {'duration': 3.72, 'start': 390.08, 'text': 'evaporating.'},
  {'duration': 4.84,
   'start': 391.76,
   'text': 'The details differ, but the large-scale'},
  {'duration': 5.6, 'start': 393.8, 'text': 'pattern follows the same logic.'},
  {'duration': 4.92,
   'start': 396.6,
   'text': 'In machine learning, too, two images can'},
  {'duration': 4.44,
   'start': 399.4,
   'text': 'have very different pixel values and'},
  {'duration': 4.04,
   'start': 401.52,
   'text': 'still belong to the same category,'},
  {'duration': 4.8,
   'start': 403.84,
   'text': 'because the system has learned which'},
  {'duration': 5.88,
   'start': 405.56,
   'text': 'differences matter and which do not.'},
  {'duration': 4.84,
   'start': 408.64,
   'text': 'It has, in a sense, discovered a useful'},
  {'duration': 3.88,
   'start': 411.44,
   'text': "notion of universality. There's an"},
  {'duration': 4.32,
   'start': 413.48,
   'text': 'especially striking meeting point'},
  {'duration': 4.56,
   'start': 415.32,
   'text': 'between these worlds called MERA, short'},
  {'duration': 4.8, 'start': 417.8, 'text': 'for multiscale entanglement'},
  {'duration': 4.64, 'start': 419.88, 'text': 'renormalization ansatz.'},
  {'duration': 3.92,
   'start': 422.6,
   'text': 'The full name is not important. The'},
  {'duration': 4.6, 'start': 424.52, 'text': 'intuition is.'},
  {'duration': 4.6,
   'start': 426.52,
   'text': 'MERA is a way physicists represent very'},
  {'duration': 3.799,
   'start': 429.12,
   'text': 'complicated quantum systems by'},
  {'duration': 3.08,
   'start': 431.12,
   'text': 'organizing information according to'},
  {'duration': 2.641, 'start': 432.919, 'text': 'scale.'},
  {'duration': 2.76,
   'start': 434.2,
   'text': 'You can think of it as a layered'},
  {'duration': 4.0, 'start': 435.56, 'text': 'blueprint.'},
  {'duration': 4.64,
   'start': 436.96,
   'text': 'Local information is handled locally.'},
  {'duration': 3.84,
   'start': 439.56,
   'text': 'Broader, longer-range structure is'},
  {'duration': 3.64, 'start': 441.6, 'text': 'handled higher up.'},
  {'duration': 3.88,
   'start': 443.4,
   'text': 'Information lives at the zoom level'},
  {'duration': 4.08,
   'start': 445.24,
   'text': 'where it matters most. A good map works'},
  {'duration': 4.84, 'start': 447.28, 'text': 'the same way.'},
  {'duration': 5.4,
   'start': 449.32,
   'text': "It doesn't store every blade of grass."},
  {'duration': 3.84,
   'start': 452.12,
   'text': 'It stores highways at one scale, streets'},
  {'duration': 4.04, 'start': 454.72, 'text': 'at another,'},
  {'duration': 5.48,
   'start': 455.96,
   'text': 'building footprints at another.'},
  {'duration': 6.16,
   'start': 458.76,
   'text': 'If you dumped every detail onto one flat'},
  {'duration': 6.32,
   'start': 461.44,
   'text': 'page, the result would be useless.'},
  {'duration': 3.44,
   'start': 464.92,
   'text': 'Structure makes information navigable.'},
  {'duration': 2.44, 'start': 467.76, 'text': 'And'},
  {'duration': 4.0,
   'start': 468.36,
   'text': ">> what's remarkable is that a mirror-style"},
  {'duration': 4.8,
   'start': 470.2,
   'text': 'physics framework resembles deep neural'},
  {'duration': 5.08,
   'start': 472.36,
   'text': 'network architecture, as both address a'},
  {'duration': 4.92,
   'start': 475.0,
   'text': 'similar challenge. How to efficiently'},
  {'duration': 5.28,
   'start': 477.44,
   'text': 'represent a vast, highly interconnected'},
  {'duration': 5.64,
   'start': 479.92,
   'text': 'system without implying that everything'},
  {'duration': 5.52,
   'start': 482.72,
   'text': 'depends equally on everything else. Then'},
  {'duration': 5.04,
   'start': 485.56,
   'text': 'comes the twist. In physics, these'},
  {'duration': 4.96,
   'start': 488.24,
   'text': 'multi-scale constructions often run from'},
  {'duration': 5.48,
   'start': 490.6,
   'text': 'fine detail to coarse summary. They'},
  {'duration': 5.76,
   'start': 493.2,
   'text': 'compress. But an AI generative model can'},
  {'duration': 4.68, 'start': 496.08, 'text': 'run the same story in reverse.'},
  {'duration': 4.16,
   'start': 498.96,
   'text': 'Start with a broad structure and'},
  {'duration': 5.0,
   'start': 500.76,
   'text': 'progressively add detail. Think of'},
  {'duration': 4.72, 'start': 503.12, 'text': 'building a video game world.'},
  {'duration': 5.36,
   'start': 505.76,
   'text': "You don't begin by placing individual"},
  {'duration': 6.72,
   'start': 507.84,
   'text': 'blades of grass across the whole planet.'},
  {'duration': 5.76,
   'start': 511.12,
   'text': 'Instead, you first define continents,'},
  {'duration': 4.64, 'start': 514.56, 'text': 'then mountain ranges,'},
  {'duration': 4.159, 'start': 516.88, 'text': 'then river systems,'},
  {'duration': 3.92, 'start': 519.2, 'text': 'then cities,'},
  {'duration': 4.601, 'start': 521.039, 'text': 'then streets,'},
  {'duration': 5.08, 'start': 523.12, 'text': 'then building details,'},
  {'duration': 4.84, 'start': 525.64, 'text': 'then textures.'},
  {'duration': 4.32, 'start': 528.2, 'text': 'Large-scale choices constrain'},
  {'duration': 4.24, 'start': 530.48, 'text': 'small-scale ones.'},
  {'duration': 4.72,
   'start': 532.52,
   'text': 'The world becomes richer as you descend'},
  {'duration': 4.119,
   'start': 534.72,
   'text': 'through levels. And that is also a good'},
  {'duration': 4.32,
   'start': 537.24,
   'text': 'way to think about certain generative'},
  {'duration': 5.241,
   'start': 538.839,
   'text': 'models in AI. Instead of memorizing'},
  {'duration': 4.84,
   'start': 541.56,
   'text': 'finished images, they learn how detail'},
  {'duration': 4.24, 'start': 544.08, 'text': 'gets added at each scale.'},
  {'duration': 4.52,
   'start': 546.4,
   'text': 'First, the rough arrangement, then the'},
  {'duration': 4.56,
   'start': 548.32,
   'text': 'object layout, then the local features,'},
  {'duration': 3.68, 'start': 550.92, 'text': 'then the fine textures.'},
  {'duration': 4.2, 'start': 552.88, 'text': 'Generation becomes a controlled'},
  {'duration': 4.64,
   'start': 554.6,
   'text': 'unfolding, rather than a magical act of'},
  {'duration': 3.92,
   'start': 557.08,
   'text': 'invention. The real currency in both'},
  {'duration': 3.4, 'start': 559.24, 'text': 'physics and deep learning is'},
  {'duration': 3.36, 'start': 561.0, 'text': 'correlation.'},
  {'duration': 3.0,
   'start': 562.64,
   'text': 'Correlation is just a fancy word for'},
  {'duration': 3.28, 'start': 564.36, 'text': 'dependence.'},
  {'duration': 3.6,
   'start': 565.64,
   'text': 'If you know one thing, does it help you'},
  {'duration': 3.08,
   'start': 567.64,
   'text': 'predict another thing better than'},
  {'duration': 4.04, 'start': 569.24, 'text': 'chance?'},
  {'duration': 4.64,
   'start': 570.72,
   'text': 'In an image, if one pixel is dark,'},
  {'duration': 4.32,
   'start': 573.28,
   'text': 'nearby pixels are more likely than'},
  {'duration': 4.12, 'start': 575.36, 'text': 'random to be dark, too.'},
  {'duration': 3.72, 'start': 577.6, 'text': 'In weather, neighboring regions'},
  {'duration': 3.28,
   'start': 579.48,
   'text': "influence one another's pressure and"},
  {'duration': 4.2, 'start': 581.32, 'text': 'temperature.'},
  {'duration': 5.16,
   'start': 582.76,
   'text': 'In a magnet, nearby atoms influence'},
  {'duration': 4.44, 'start': 585.52, 'text': 'whether their neighbors align.'},
  {'duration': 4.32,
   'start': 587.92,
   'text': 'If correlations are mostly local, that'},
  {'duration': 4.72,
   'start': 589.96,
   'text': 'is wonderful news. It means you can'},
  {'duration': 4.24,
   'start': 592.24,
   'text': "summarize the world in chunks. You don't"},
  {'duration': 4.16,
   'start': 594.68,
   'text': 'need every part to talk directly to'},
  {'duration': 4.72,
   'start': 596.48,
   'text': 'every other part all at once. Local'},
  {'duration': 4.28,
   'start': 598.84,
   'text': 'patterns can be compressed first and'},
  {'duration': 4.04,
   'start': 601.2,
   'text': 'larger scale structure can be built from'},
  {'duration': 3.8,
   'start': 603.12,
   'text': 'those compressed summaries. And this'},
  {'duration': 3.16,
   'start': 605.24,
   'text': 'helps explain why deep learning can'},
  {'duration': 3.8, 'start': 606.92, 'text': 'generalize.'},
  {'duration': 4.08,
   'start': 608.4,
   'text': 'A useful model is learning reusable'},
  {'duration': 4.76, 'start': 610.72, 'text': 'correlation patterns.'},
  {'duration': 6.52,
   'start': 612.48,
   'text': 'Curved edge plus eye-like texture plus'},
  {'duration': 5.68,
   'start': 615.48,
   'text': 'ear-like triangle plus fur-like patch at'},
  {'duration': 4.08, 'start': 619.0, 'text': 'the right scale.'},
  {'duration': 4.4,
   'start': 621.16,
   'text': 'Those patterns can appear in many new'},
  {'duration': 5.4,
   'start': 623.08,
   'text': 'examples. Generalization comes from'},
  {'duration': 5.08,
   'start': 625.56,
   'text': 'discovering structure that repeats. And'},
  {'duration': 4.56,
   'start': 628.48,
   'text': 'a lot of older approaches in both'},
  {'duration': 4.76,
   'start': 630.64,
   'text': 'physics-inspired modeling and machine'},
  {'duration': 4.84,
   'start': 633.04,
   'text': 'learning were willing to throw enormous'},
  {'duration': 5.96, 'start': 635.4, 'text': 'computation at messy problems.'},
  {'duration': 5.6,
   'start': 637.88,
   'text': 'Sample more. Estimate more. Bruteforce'},
  {'duration': 4.56, 'start': 641.36, 'text': 'your way through the tangle.'},
  {'duration': 5.2,
   'start': 643.48,
   'text': 'The multiscale perspective says, maybe'},
  {'duration': 5.16,
   'start': 645.92,
   'text': 'the tangle has shape. Maybe the reason'},
  {'duration': 5.24,
   'start': 648.68,
   'text': 'the problem is solvable at all is that'},
  {'duration': 4.8,
   'start': 651.08,
   'text': 'reality is organized. Another way to say'},
  {'duration': 3.88,
   'start': 653.92,
   'text': 'this is through the language of hidden'},
  {'duration': 4.959, 'start': 655.88, 'text': 'causes.'},
  {'duration': 4.44,
   'start': 657.8,
   'text': 'Imagine a layered causal story behind an'},
  {'duration': 3.241, 'start': 660.839, 'text': 'image.'},
  {'duration': 4.0,
   'start': 662.24,
   'text': 'At a high level, maybe the scene'},
  {'duration': 4.28, 'start': 664.08, 'text': 'contains an animal.'},
  {'duration': 5.08,
   'start': 666.24,
   'text': 'At the next level, that animal is'},
  {'duration': 5.64, 'start': 668.36, 'text': 'cat-like sitting indoors.'},
  {'duration': 6.08,
   'start': 671.32,
   'text': 'Lower levels specify a face shape, ear'},
  {'duration': 5.36,
   'start': 674.0,
   'text': 'positions, fur patterns, and whiskers.'},
  {'duration': 5.92,
   'start': 677.4,
   'text': 'Lower still determines lighting,'},
  {'duration': 7.72,
   'start': 679.36,
   'text': 'shading, and exact pixel intensities.'},
  {'duration': 5.56,
   'start': 683.32,
   'text': 'Each layer refines the one above it.'},
  {'duration': 4.48,
   'start': 687.08,
   'text': 'This is close to what a Bayesian network'},
  {'duration': 4.72,
   'start': 688.88,
   'text': 'tries to capture. Visible things arise'},
  {'duration': 4.32,
   'start': 691.56,
   'text': 'from hidden causes arranged in a'},
  {'duration': 4.16, 'start': 693.6, 'text': 'structured dependency graph.'},
  {'duration': 3.96,
   'start': 695.88,
   'text': 'The important constraint is that not'},
  {'duration': 3.52,
   'start': 697.76,
   'text': 'everything should depend directly on'},
  {'duration': 3.76, 'start': 699.84, 'text': 'everything else.'},
  {'duration': 5.28,
   'start': 701.28,
   'text': 'If every pixel depended on every other'},
  {'duration': 4.72,
   'start': 703.6,
   'text': 'pixel in one giant soup, computation'},
  {'duration': 3.56, 'start': 706.56, 'text': 'would be hopeless.'},
  {'duration': 3.28,
   'start': 708.32,
   'text': 'Structure is what keeps the problem'},
  {'duration': 3.04, 'start': 710.12, 'text': 'tractable.'},
  {'duration': 2.96,
   'start': 711.6,
   'text': 'That also corrects another common'},
  {'duration': 3.52, 'start': 713.16, 'text': 'misconception.'},
  {'duration': 4.12,
   'start': 714.56,
   'text': 'Generative AI models are often described'},
  {'duration': 3.64,
   'start': 716.68,
   'text': 'as if they possess a kind of mystical'},
  {'duration': 3.04, 'start': 718.68, 'text': 'imagination.'},
  {'duration': 4.08,
   'start': 720.32,
   'text': 'A better description is that they are'},
  {'duration': 4.72,
   'start': 721.72,
   'text': 'structured probability machines.'},
  {'duration': 4.24,
   'start': 724.4,
   'text': 'They learn which possibilities tend to'},
  {'duration': 5.04,
   'start': 726.44,
   'text': 'go with which others, and they arrange'},
  {'duration': 4.72,
   'start': 728.64,
   'text': 'those possibilities across scales. And'},
  {'duration': 3.0,
   'start': 731.48,
   'text': 'this leads to a subtle and important'},
  {'duration': 3.48, 'start': 733.36, 'text': 'lesson.'},
  {'duration': 5.88,
   'start': 734.48,
   'text': 'We often talk as if intelligence comes'},
  {'duration': 5.48,
   'start': 736.84,
   'text': 'mainly from making AI models bigger.'},
  {'duration': 4.12, 'start': 740.36, 'text': 'Bigger can certainly help.'},
  {'duration': 4.04,
   'start': 742.32,
   'text': 'But scale organization is a different'},
  {'duration': 4.24, 'start': 744.48, 'text': 'source of power.'},
  {'duration': 4.72,
   'start': 746.36,
   'text': 'A system can gain enormous efficiency by'},
  {'duration': 4.4,
   'start': 748.72,
   'text': 'dividing the problem into levels,'},
  {'duration': 4.0,
   'start': 751.08,
   'text': 'each responsible for patterns at its own'},
  {'duration': 4.88, 'start': 753.12, 'text': 'zoom setting.'},
  {'duration': 5.36,
   'start': 755.08,
   'text': 'Each layer handles a smaller job.'},
  {'duration': 4.839,
   'start': 758.0,
   'text': 'Global coherence then emerges from many'},
  {'duration': 4.52,
   'start': 760.44,
   'text': 'local decisions working together. You'},
  {'duration': 4.081,
   'start': 762.839,
   'text': 'can see this design principle all over'},
  {'duration': 5.36, 'start': 764.96, 'text': 'modern AI.'},
  {'duration': 5.76,
   'start': 766.92,
   'text': 'Vision systems often use image pyramids.'},
  {'duration': 3.96,
   'start': 770.32,
   'text': 'U-Nets mix fine detail with coarse'},
  {'duration': 3.84, 'start': 772.68, 'text': 'context.'},
  {'duration': 4.72,
   'start': 774.28,
   'text': 'Many generative systems create outputs'},
  {'duration': 4.52, 'start': 776.52, 'text': 'in multiple resolutions.'},
  {'duration': 4.16,
   'start': 779.0,
   'text': 'Hierarchical latent models try to'},
  {'duration': 4.24,
   'start': 781.04,
   'text': 'separate broad factors from fine'},
  {'duration': 3.96, 'start': 783.16, 'text': 'variation.'},
  {'duration': 4.4,
   'start': 785.28,
   'text': 'The names differ, but the idea keeps'},
  {'duration': 4.96,
   'start': 787.12,
   'text': 'returning. Build representations that'},
  {'duration': 5.08, 'start': 789.68, 'text': 'respect scale.'},
  {'duration': 4.8,
   'start': 792.08,
   'text': 'Physics gives this idea extra depth'},
  {'duration': 4.6, 'start': 794.76, 'text': 'through phase transitions.'},
  {'duration': 5.32,
   'start': 796.88,
   'text': 'Think of water freezing or a magnet'},
  {'duration': 5.92,
   'start': 799.36,
   'text': 'suddenly becoming magnetized. Near these'},
  {'duration': 6.24,
   'start': 802.2,
   'text': 'transitions, tiny local interactions can'},
  {'duration': 6.64,
   'start': 805.28,
   'text': 'produce dramatic global behavior.'},
  {'duration': 6.88,
   'start': 808.44,
   'text': 'The whole system starts acting as one.'},
  {'duration': 5.72,
   'start': 811.92,
   'text': 'That is emergence. Large-scale order'},
  {'duration': 4.56, 'start': 815.32, 'text': 'arising from many small-scale'},
  {'duration': 3.52,
   'start': 817.64,
   'text': 'relationships. Deep learning has an echo'},
  {'duration': 3.52, 'start': 819.88, 'text': 'of this.'},
  {'duration': 4.84,
   'start': 821.16,
   'text': 'A network starts with local cues like'},
  {'duration': 5.92,
   'start': 823.4,
   'text': 'edges and textures, yet can eventually'},
  {'duration': 4.76,
   'start': 826.0,
   'text': 'form a stable concept like face or'},
  {'duration': 3.52, 'start': 829.32, 'text': 'chair.'},
  {'duration': 4.72,
   'start': 830.76,
   'text': 'The global meaning is not stored in any'},
  {'duration': 5.04, 'start': 832.84, 'text': 'single pixel or neuron alone.'},
  {'duration': 4.68,
   'start': 835.48,
   'text': 'It emerges from layered interactions.'},
  {'duration': 4.24,
   'start': 837.88,
   'text': 'And we should be careful not to push the'},
  {'duration': 3.84, 'start': 840.16, 'text': 'analogy too far.'},
  {'duration': 4.12,
   'start': 842.12,
   'text': 'A neural network is not literally a'},
  {'duration': 5.56,
   'start': 844.0,
   'text': 'universe, and the brain is not just a'},
  {'duration': 5.12,
   'start': 846.24,
   'text': 'renormalization algorithm with a pulse.'},
  {'duration': 4.16,
   'start': 849.56,
   'text': 'But the analogy is powerful because it'},
  {'duration': 4.0, 'start': 851.36, 'text': 'highlights a shared principle.'},
  {'duration': 4.6,
   'start': 853.72,
   'text': 'Whether you are studying matter,'},
  {'duration': 4.52,
   'start': 855.36,
   'text': 'weather, images, language, or maybe even'},
  {'duration': 3.88, 'start': 858.32, 'text': 'thought itself,'},
  {'duration': 4.68,
   'start': 859.88,
   'text': 'you often succeed by finding the right'},
  {'duration': 4.92,
   'start': 862.2,
   'text': 'summaries at each scale. That gives us a'},
  {'duration': 4.24,
   'start': 864.56,
   'text': 'new way to frame deep learning.'},
  {'duration': 3.76,
   'start': 867.12,
   'text': 'We can think of it as a machine for'},
  {'duration': 4.68, 'start': 868.8, 'text': 'building compressed multi-scale'},
  {'duration': 5.4, 'start': 870.88, 'text': 'descriptions of reality.'},
  {'duration': 4.76,
   'start': 873.48,
   'text': 'It learns what to keep, what to discard,'},
  {'duration': 4.2,
   'start': 876.28,
   'text': 'and how local patterns combine into'},
  {'duration': 3.72,
   'start': 878.24,
   'text': 'broader meaning. And that may be why the'},
  {'duration': 3.56, 'start': 880.48, 'text': 'connection to physics feels so'},
  {'duration': 4.56, 'start': 881.96, 'text': 'satisfying.'},
  {'duration': 4.76,
   'start': 884.04,
   'text': 'Physics, at its best, explains how'},
  {'duration': 4.319,
   'start': 886.52,
   'text': 'simple interactions produce the complex'},
  {'duration': 4.84, 'start': 888.8, 'text': 'world we see.'},
  {'duration': 4.841,
   'start': 890.839,
   'text': 'Deep learning, at its best, exploits the'},
  {'duration': 3.4,
   'start': 893.64,
   'text': 'fact that this world is not random'},
  {'duration': 4.159, 'start': 895.68, 'text': 'static.'},
  {'duration': 5.72,
   'start': 897.04,
   'text': 'It is layered. It has neighborhoods,'},
  {'duration': 4.601,
   'start': 899.839,
   'text': 'parts, wholes, and recurring patterns'},
  {'duration': 4.44, 'start': 902.76, 'text': 'across scales.'},
  {'duration': 5.6, 'start': 904.44, 'text': 'So here is the final click.'},
  {'duration': 6.08,
   'start': 907.2,
   'text': 'Maybe physics and AI are circling the'},
  {'duration': 5.28,
   'start': 910.04,
   'text': 'same deep question from different'},
  {'duration': 4.68, 'start': 913.28, 'text': 'directions.'},
  {'duration': 4.28,
   'start': 915.32,
   'text': 'Physics asks, when you zoom out, what'},
  {'duration': 5.2, 'start': 917.96, 'text': 'survives?'},
  {'duration': 6.6,
   'start': 919.6,
   'text': 'AI asks, when you compress experience,'},
  {'duration': 5.4, 'start': 923.16, 'text': 'what remains useful?'},
  {'duration': 5.16,
   'start': 926.2,
   'text': 'In both cases, understanding is about'},
  {'duration': 6.28,
   'start': 928.56,
   'text': 'preserving what matters, and that is the'},
  {'duration': 5.24,
   'start': 931.36,
   'text': 'bizarre connection to the universe.'},
  {'duration': 4.24,
   'start': 934.84,
   'text': 'Deep neural networks work because they'},
  {'duration': 5.68,
   'start': 936.6,
   'text': 'echo a strategy nature itself seems to'},
  {'duration': 5.32,
   'start': 939.08,
   'text': 'reward. Build meaning level by level,'},
  {'duration': 5.04,
   'start': 942.28,
   'text': 'from the local to the global, from'},
  {'duration': 4.28,
   'start': 944.4,
   'text': 'detail to structure, from chaos to'},
  {'duration': 3.32, 'start': 947.32, 'text': 'pattern.'},
  {'duration': 4.2,
   'start': 948.68,
   'text': 'Once you see that, the word deep in'},
  {'duration': 6.72,
   'start': 950.64,
   'text': 'neural networks sounds like a theory of'},
  {'duration': 4.48,
   'start': 952.88,
   'text': 'how complexity becomes understandable.'}]]
